49
00:06:13.248 --> 00:06:14.582
Idiot.

50
00:06:15.125 --> 00:06:17.043
These are stacks
of hundreds right here.
- Easy.

51
00:06:17.127 --> 00:06:18.627
I've already
counted them twice.
They're good.

52
00:06:18.795 --> 00:06:20.838
- Good deal.
- Pass me more bands.

53
00:06:21.089 --> 00:06:23.549
