132
00:10:50.066 --> 00:10:51.317
Come on, your dad's
important to me.

133
00:10:51.401 --> 00:10:54.194
I know it.
I love that
you love him.

134
00:10:58.241 --> 00:10:59.742
Hurley!
Hey, Dad!

135
00:10:59.909 --> 00:11:01.410
...you think, and you'll...

136
00:11:01.870 --> 00:11:04.371
Hey! Howard,
excuse me a second.
Sure, sure.

137
00:11:04.456 --> 00:11:06.165
